

USER:
Error: TypeError: ChatInterface.__init__() got an unexpected keyword argument 'placeholder'

CLAUDE:
Quick fix — placeholder isn't a valid argument for gr.ChatInterface in Gradio 5. 
Replace the gr.ChatInterface block — remove the title="" and placeholder=... lines:

    # Old (broken) code:
    gr.ChatInterface(
        fn          = chat_with_finn,
        title       = "",
        placeholder = "Ask Finn anything about your finances...",
        examples    = [...]
    )

    # Fixed code:
    gr.ChatInterface(
        fn       = chat_with_finn,
        examples = [...]
    )

Those arguments don't exist in Gradio 5's ChatInterface. Everything else stays the same.

